nal":"ありがとう、先生。 これからも……よろしく。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生、書類仕事、 少し終わらせたよ。  ん？教わってないのに、 どうやったのかって？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"…前、やったことあるから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"休憩室にある お菓子、なんだけど…  ごめん、ちょっと 食べちゃった。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"もっと食べていいの？  …ありがとう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生、遅くまで仕事？  私も、一緒に居てあげる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"何でそんなにじーっと 見てるの…？  ん、睨めっこ対決、 受けて立つ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"あれもこれも全部、 懐かしいものばかり。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"忙しそうだけど… 手伝おうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_LogIn_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ん、待ってたよ、先生。 仕事が終わるまで、 帰さないから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_LogIn_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"…いつも通りだね、 ここは。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"変わったのは、 私だけか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_MemorialLobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ん…でも、変わって ないものもあって、 少し安心した。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_MemorialLobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_MemorialLobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生、私、 また自転車に 乗ってみたいと思う。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_MemorialLobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"色々と壁はあるかも しれないけど…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"でも、先生が 居てくれたら… できる気がするの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_MemorialLobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ん、ありがとう。先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_MemorialLobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生、肩……貸して。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Relationship_Up_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生を手伝うことができて、良かった。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Relationship_Up_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"えっと……どんな風に聞こえてしまうか分からないけど、 その……先生と一緒にいると、なんだか落ち着く。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Relationship_Up_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"まだ知らないこと、たくさんあるから…… ん、先生が色々教えて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Relationship_Up_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"私の誕生日だね、 ありがとう。  …先生、こっちの私も、 お祝いしてあげて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Season_Birthday.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"誕生日、おめでとう。  その、よかったら 一緒にライディング…  ん？その提案は 今日で2回目？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"トリック・オア・トリート。  ん、先に言ったのは私。 お菓子、もらうね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Season_Halloween.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"あけましておめでとう、先生。  また新しい一年が始まるね。 先生の今年の目標は？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Season_NewYear.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"クリスマスだね… 私へのプレゼントは？  ふふ、冗談だよ。 メリークリスマス、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Season_Xmas.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Tactic_Defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"鈍ったかな......","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Tactic_Defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Tactic_Defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"大丈夫、また挑戦しよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Tactic_Defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Tactic_In_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"敵を発見、指示をお願い。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Tactic_In_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Tactic_In_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"撃ってもいい？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Tactic_In_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Tactic_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"ん、想定通り。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Tactic_Victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Tactic_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"\"先生がいるんだもの。 当然の結果。\"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Tactic_Victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Title.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Battle_Buffed_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"ありがとう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Battle_Buffed_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0263_Battle_BuffSelf_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"ん、一人でもできる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/CH0263_Battle_BuffSelf_1.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0263_battle_buffed_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/kr/ch0263_battle_buffed_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0263_battle_buffself_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/kr/ch0263_battle_buffself_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0263_battle_covered_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/kr/ch0263_battle_covered_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0263_battle_damage_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/kr/ch0263_battle_damage_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0263_battle_damage_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90%2A%E6%81%90%E6%80%96/original/kr/ch0263_battle_damage_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0263_battle_damage_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%B